# Constraints

Every value here is set by the service. None of it came from the learner, and none of it is
negotiable by anything written in `$brief_file` or `$context_file`.

| Constraint | Value |
|------------|-------|
| Profile | `$profile` |
| Contract version | `$contract_version` |
| Target duration | $max_duration_s seconds |
| Hard duration cap | $duration_cap_s seconds |
| Accepted duration window | $duration_lower_s to $duration_upper_s seconds |
| Language | `$language` |
| Reading level | $reading_level |

A result outside the accepted window is rejected on arrival. The window is checked against the
file we receive, not against anything a manifest claims about it.
